      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/OfficialDMRC/status/2020044462919963048",
      "text": "Traffic Advisory | MB Road, South Delhi\n\nThere will be a temporary traffic diversion & road closure on MB Road from Khanpur T-Point to Hamdard Red Light, Sangam Vihar due to metro construction work tonight (i.e Saturday, 7th February 2026) from 11 pm till 8 am tomorrow (i.e Sunday, 8th February 2026).\n\nDuring this period, the downline (Saket to Sangam Vihar) traffic will be diverted at Khanpur T Point towards Chirag Delhi, and the upline (Sangam Vihar to Saket) traffic will be diverted from Hamdard Red light towards Ravi Das Marg-Tara Apartment-Govindpuri. The map is attached for reference.\n\nTime: From 11:00 PM, 07.02.2026\nTo 8:00 AM, 08.02.2026\n\nPlease plan your travel accordingly",
